The Prime Minister, Shri Narendra Modi has condoled the passing of Mr. Kuchi Rangkau Zeliang, son of Nagaland’s Deputy CM, Mr. TR Zeliang. Shri Modi conveyed his heartfelt condolences to the bereaved family and their friends in this hour of grief, and prayed for the eternal peace of the departed soul.
The Prime Minister  posted on X;
Pained by the untimely passing of Mr. Kuchi Rangkau Zeliang, son of Nagaland’s Deputy CM, Mr. TR Zeliang. My thoughts are with the Zeliang family and their friends in this hour of grief. May the departed soul rest in peace.
